        <h1>Fancy Fielder</h1>
        <div class="articletext">
        <h3 class="byline">By Bryce Martin</h3>
        	<p>1949,<br>
		He is mine,<br>
		Ruth Ann said, my dream in a tux,<br>
		Eddie Waitkus, ballplayer deluxe.</p>

		<p>He moved well around first.<br>
		Too well, perhaps,<br>
		For a dame with a thirst,<br>
		A desire for certain chaps,<br>
		Those in uniform<br>
		Of Lithuanian descent,<br>
		With smooth athletic form.</p>

		<p>No words spoken, not a hint,<br>
		Until one night a note appeared<br>
		Asking him to indulge a whim.<br>
		Her bullet split his boutonniere.<br>
		She was so happy for her and him.</p>
     </div>
